          <groundspeak:finder id="4853503">gumbyphv</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;I found BCP401 A.I.R.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were headed to Canmore for a family weekend but had to come up to the Calahoo area to drop our dog Rambo off at friends for the weekend.  Mrs. Gumby wanted to visit for a little bit so I took the opportunity to come and find some caches.  When I got here my GPS took me into the middle the intersection.  Luckily it wasn't a busy place so I stood there and looked around and spotted the marker posts.  Made the short walk over and found the cap.  Thanks for another great cap.  TFTBC  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
